      "lines": [
        "公式：",
        "$\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta=\\frac{1}{2}[\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)+\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)]$.　(6)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由等式 (5) 两边分别减去等式 (4) 的两边，得到：",
        "$\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta=\\frac{1}{2}[\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)-\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)]$.　(7)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 2　把 $\\cos^2 x\\cos3x$ 写成三角函数的和的形式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "首先用 $\\frac{1+\\cos2x}{2}$ 代替 $\\cos^2 x$，于是得到：",
        "$\\frac{1}{2}(1+\\cos2x)\\cos3x=\\frac{1}{2}\\cos3x+\\frac{1}{2}\\cos2x\\cos3x$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在利用 (6) 式：",
        "$\\frac{1}{2}\\cos3x+\\frac{1}{2}\\cos2x\\cos3x=\\frac{1}{2}\\cos3x+\\frac{1}{4}(\\cos x+\\cos5x)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，",
        "$\\cos^2 x\\cos3x=\\frac{1}{2}\\cos3x+\\frac{1}{4}\\cos x+\\frac{1}{4}\\cos5x$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "结果得到的式子中，三角函数都是一次的。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
